DESCRIPTION:Leave the real world behind and come to Sillypun Valley. It's T
 im Vine with a barrage of new drivel. The joke conveyor belt is set to full
  speed. Expect daft gags by the handful\, stupid props on an oblong table a
 nd a sprinkling of musical interloons. It's a show without a message. It's 
 Timmaterial. The Man with the Golden Pun has reloaded and he's aiming at yo
 u. Stand by and sit down. Strap in and let go. Come Onnnnnnnnnn! The manage
 ment reminds you to breathe normally between jokes to avoid suffocation. 'A
  joyous explosion' (Times).\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atla
 s/event/tim-vine-sillypun-valley/
